**/build/
/local.properties
*.iml
.DS_Store
apps/android/google-services.json
google-services.json
apps/android/release.keystore
*.keystore
# The debug keystore is deliberately committed. Its credentials are the public
# Android SDK constants (android/androiddebugkey), so it is not a secret, and CI
# needs it: without a fixed key every published APK is signed with a throwaway
# key and cannot update the previous install. The release keystore stays ignored.
!apps/android/debug.keystore
logcat_*.txt
